  "html": "<div id=\"questionExplanation-118232\" class=\"questionExplanation\" style=\"display: block;\"><p>We choose an arbitrary point on the plane as the starting point (tail) of the vector. The vertical line shows the north direction.</p>\n<div id=\"graphic-q-118232-e-0\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/q-118232-e-0\"></div>\n\n<p>We go <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"4\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msup><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c38\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-texatom><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.393em;\"><mjx-texatom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2218\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-texatom></mjx-script></mjx-msup></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mn>80</mn></mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>∘</mo></mrow></msup></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> clockwise from the north. </p>\n<div id=\"graphic-q-118232-a-1\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/q-118232-a-1\"></div>\n\n<p>The length of the line segment of the vector represents the displacement of the person (which is <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"5\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"6\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6B\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>km</mtext></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>).</p>\n</div>",
